{"id":"en_the-fae-wife-who-made-them-kneel","title":"The Fae Wife Who Made Them Kneel","titleEn":"The Fae Wife Who Made Them Kneel","description":"Seraphina is treated with contempt, dismissed as a barren and powerless wife while her husband carries on openly with a sorceress. In truth, she is the final descendant of the legendary Bone-Stone bloodline. When she can bear no more, she sheds her pretense and lets loose fearsome magic, exposing the secret wealth that has been keeping the impoverished court afloat. A single word from her severs their funding, leaves her husband destroyed, and restores her own dominion. Her revenge has only just begun.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-fae-wife-who-made-them-kneel/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-fae-wife-who-made-them-kneel/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Fantasy Romance","Karma Payback","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt2xc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-fae-wife-who-made-them-kneel_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt2xc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-fae-wife-who-made-them-kneel_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt2xc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-fae-wife-who-made-them-kneel_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt2xc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-fae-wife-who-made-them-kneel_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","ur